# Water Trial - Elemental Battle Cutscene
# Features ocean ambience, flowing dialogue, and the Water Elemental encounter

@backdrop textures/room.png [fadeIn=800]
@char HERO sprite=characters/male
@char WATER_ELEMENTAL sprite=monsters/water_elemental

@do playBgm [name=audio/ocean-waves.mp3]

wait 800

# The Water Elemental emerges

*WATER_ELEMENTAL: [cutin=size=large,expression=neutral]
"""
The depths whisper of your arrival...
Few have survived my crushing embrace.
"""

wait 600

HERO: [expression=neutral,position=left]
"""
I've defeated the Fire Guardian.
The Water trial won't stop me!
"""

wait 500

WATER_ELEMENTAL: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
Fire and water are opposites, mortal.
What worked there will fail here.
Adaptability is my domain!
"""

@do playSfx [name=audio/icy-passage.mp3]

wait 600

*HERO: [cutin=size=large,expression=worried]
"""
Then I'll adapt too!
A true hero learns from every battle!
"""

wait 800

@transition wipe [duration=500]

wait 500

@backdrop textures/sewer.gif [fadeIn=600]
@do playBgm [name=audio/distorted-communication.mp3]

# The trial deepens

WATER_ELEMENTAL: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
The currents shift constantly.
Can you keep up, land-dweller?
"""

wait 500

HERO: [expression=tired,position=left]
"""
The pressure... it's like being crushed...
I can barely breathe...
"""

wait 600

*WATER_ELEMENTAL: [cutin=size=large,expression=neutral]
"""
This is the weight of the ocean!
Accept its embrace... or drown!
"""

wait 600

HERO: [expression=smile,position=left]
"""
Wait... water flows around obstacles...
Instead of fighting the current...
I should move WITH it!
"""

@do playSfx [name=audio/dungeon-beat.mp3]

wait 800

@transition fadeOutBackdrop [duration=500]

wait 500

@backdrop textures/room.png [fadeIn=600]
@do playBgm [name=audio/calm-escape.mp3]

# Victory

WATER_ELEMENTAL: [expression=neutral,position=right]
"""
You... understood my lesson.
Not resistance, but harmony.
"""

wait 500

HERO: [expression=smile,position=left]
"""
Fighting against the tide exhausts you.
But flowing with it... that's strength!
"""

*WATER_ELEMENTAL: [cutin=size=large,expression=neutral]
"""
The Water Shard is yours.
May its wisdom guide you through troubled times.
Two trials remain, young hero...
"""

wait 800

@do playBgm [name=audio/dawns-peak.mp3]

@transition wipe [duration=700]

waitInput

@end
